      "content": "Thanks, that makes sense. I've already tried grouping them by cost center but it hasn't yielded much. The issue is that these amounts are tiny—sometimes just a few euros—and they seem to pop up almost randomly. It feels like they are just \"slipping through the cracks\" of our current oversight.\n\nWhat specific types of documentation or digital trails should I be cross-referencing to see if these small bits of spending are being hidden or just miscategorized? I want to be sure I'm not missing something subtle.",
