      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'll start looking into those petty cash logs and inventory gaps. One thing that's really bothering me is how these amounts seem to appear right when we transition between different staff shifts or during holiday periods. It's like they're intentionally avoiding being caught by the usual checks. \n\nIs there any way to use data analytics to catch these \"invisible\" little errors? I'm looking for a way to flag these tiny, annoying bits of data that seem to just be lurking in the background of our reports.",
